msgid "Stare"
msgstr "Mirar fijamente"

msgid "Stare passionately"
msgstr "Mirar con pasión"

msgid "Stare calmly"
msgstr "Mirar con calma"

msgid "Stare blankly"
msgstr "Mirar distraído"

msgid "About Kushieda"
msgstr "Sobre Kushieda"

msgid "Memories involving you are kinda vague"
msgstr "Los recuerdos contigo son algo vagos"

msgid "Did we have a chat on Christmas Eve?"
msgstr "¿Charlamos en Nochebuena?"

msgid "You always seem so busy"
msgstr "Siempre pareces estar muy ocupada"

msgid "About Taiga"
msgstr "Sobre Taiga"

msgid "She's the type to keep her promises"
msgstr "Es de las que cumplen sus promesas"

msgid "She can be a little nosy at times"
msgstr "A veces es un poco entrometida"

msgid "She eats a little too much, I think"
msgstr "Creo que come un poco de más"

msgid "About Ghosts"
msgstr "Sobre los fantasmas"

msgid "Think we'll see the ghost?"
msgstr "¿Crees que veamos al fantasma?"

msgid "Do you believe in ghosts?"
msgstr "¿Crees en los fantasmas?"

msgid "They say the ghost is beautiful"
msgstr "Dicen que el fantasma es hermoso"

msgid "About Classmates"
msgstr "Sobre los compañeros"

msgid "I had a blast at Luxure with everyone"
msgstr "Me divertí mucho en Luxure con todos"

msgid "I wish Kihara and Kashii had come too"
msgstr "Ojalá hubieran venido Kihara y Kashii"

msgid "Not sure I can remember all their faces"
msgstr "No sé si recuerdo todas sus caras"

msgid "About the New Semester"
msgstr "Sobre el nuevo semestre"

msgid "The field trip's right around the corner"
msgstr "Ya casi llega el viaje escolar"

msgid "Kinda bummed to be going back to school"
msgstr "Me desanima un poco volver a la escuela"

msgid "Soon we'll have to part ways with them"
msgstr "Pronto tendremos que separarnos de ellos"

msgid "--Let's Distract Minori From Ghost＿Stories!--"
msgstr "--¡Distraigamos a Minori de las＿historias de fantasmas!--"

msgid "Minori「This is kinda...... yeah.」"
msgstr "Minori「Esto es un poco...... sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「Sorry, that's kinda intense.」"
msgstr "Minori「Perdón, es algo intenso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「Sorry.」"
msgstr "Minori「Perdón.」"

msgid "Minori「What's up? See anything?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué pasa? ¿Ves algo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No......」"

msgid "Minori「Are you seeing a vision, perhaps?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Acaso estás teniendo una visión?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Where did that come from?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y eso a qué viene?」"

msgid "Minori「Don't stand behind me......」"
msgstr "Minori「No te pongas detrás de mí......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「I thought I'd add a voiceover to that＿expression of yours!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Pensé en ponerle voz a＿esa expresión tuya!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué?!」"

msgid "Minori「Hehehe! I'm kidding! Kidding!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Jejeje! ¡Es broma! ¡Es broma!」"

msgid "Minori「Oooh...... I can't take it!」"
msgstr "Minori「Uuuy...... ¡No lo soporto!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「A subzero stare, fitting of a midwinter＿test of courage～!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Una mirada bajo cero, digna de＿una prueba de valor invernal～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is that supposed to be a＿compliment......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Se supone que eso es un cumplido......?」"

msgid "Minori「......I'm sorry.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Lo siento.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why are you apologizing?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué te disculpas?」"

msgid "Minori「It's for, you know, a lot of things, I＿guess.」"
msgstr "Minori「Es por, ya sabes, muchas cosas, supongo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......O-Okay then.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......E-Está bien entonces.」"

msgid "Minori「YOO-HOOOO!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡YUUU-JUUU!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Er, what was that for?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? Ehm, ¿a qué vino eso?」"

msgid "Minori「Well, I thought maybe you weren't＿listening, see.」"
msgstr "Minori「Bueno, pensé que tal vez no me＿estabas escuchando, ¿ves?」"

msgid "Minori「You can't will the ghost to appear just＿from staring really hard.」"
msgstr "Minori「No puedes hacer que aparezca el fantasma＿solo mirando muy fijo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, uh, that wasn't what I was hoping＿for......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, eh, eso no era lo que esperaba......」"

msgid "Minori「......If you don't have anything to talk＿about, let's get a move on.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Si no tienes nada de qué＿hablar, sigamos adelante.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, err, sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, ehm, perdón.」"

msgid "Minori「Umm..................」"
msgstr "Minori「Ehm..................」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, err, sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, ehm, perdón.」"

msgid "Minori「What're you apologizing for?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Por qué te disculpas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just felt like I should......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sentí que debía hacerlo......」"

msgid "Minori「Hmmm...... So?」"
msgstr "Minori「Mmmm...... ¿Y?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Well, I'm sure they'll return......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「B-Bueno, seguro que volverán......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What? W-Why are you so upset......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué? ¿P-Por qué te enojas tanto......?」"

msgid "Minori「Because you're being too hard on＿yourself!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Porque eres demasiado＿duro contigo mismo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......No I'm not.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No lo soy.」"

msgid "Minori「Hmmm.」"
msgstr "Minori「Mmmm.」"

msgid "Minori「I see......」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya veo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, so if I say something or respond＿in a way that doesn't make sense, let＿me know.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, así que si digo algo o respondo＿de una forma sin sentido, avísame.」"

msgid "Minori「Okay......」"
msgstr "Minori「Está bien......」"

msgid "Minori「Maybe? I'm not sure.」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Tal vez? No estoy segura.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You don't remember?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿No lo recuerdas?」"

msgid "Minori「If we did, I doubt it was about anything＿important.」"
msgstr "Minori「Si lo hicimos, dudo que fuera＿sobre algo importante.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo......」"

msgid "Minori「Why are you asking me that?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Por qué me preguntas eso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, I was just a little curious...... Umm,＿did I say something I shouldn't have?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, tenía algo de curiosidad......＿Ehm, ¿dije algo que no debía?」"

msgid "Minori「......We didn't. Not really.」"
msgstr "Minori「......No charlamos. En realidad, no.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............I, I see.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............Y-Ya veo.」"

msgid "Minori「Did you remember something?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Recordaste algo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, it's one of my fuzzy areas.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, esa parte la tengo borrosa.」"

msgid "Minori「......I see.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Ya veo.」"

msgid "Minori「Do I really seem that busy?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿De verdad parezco tan ocupada?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, that's the impression you give.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, esa es la impresión que das.」"

msgid "Minori「Hmmm. I guess anyone would see me＿that way around this time of year.」"
msgstr "Minori「Mmmm. Supongo que cualquiera me vería＿así en esta época del año.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Must be tough. Don't push yourself too＿much.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Debe ser duro. No te esfuerces＿demasiado.」"

msgid "Minori「Okay.」"
msgstr "Minori「Está bien.」"

msgid "Minori「You ain't seen nothing yet! I can handle＿way more!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡No has visto nada todavía!＿¡Puedo aguantar mucho más!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Really? Don't push yourself too hard.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿En serio? No te exijas demasiado.」"

msgid "Minori「Roger that!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Entendido!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's insane.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso es una locura.」"

msgid "Minori「What? It's from \"Labor Mystery Files\"!」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué? ¡Es de \"Archivos misteriosos＿del trabajo\"!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I feel like I heard about that a long＿time ago......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Siento que oí hablar de eso＿hace mucho tiempo......」"

msgid "Minori「That's our Takasu-kun, always paying＿attention! Well done!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ese es nuestro Takasu-kun, siempre＿atento! ¡¡Bien hecho!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, thanks.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, gracias.」"

msgid "Minori「Indeedy! Taiga's got a strong sense of＿duty! Aw no, you got me braggin' about＿her! Crap! I'm swooning!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Exacto! ¡Taiga tiene un gran sentido＿del deber! ¡Ay no, me hiciste presumir＿de ella! ¡Rayos! ¡Me desmayo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'll catch you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo te atrapo.」"

msgid "Minori「You needn't worry. Ehe!」"
msgstr "Minori「No te preocupes. ¡Eje!」"

msgid "Minori「But I get worried sometimes when she＿pushes herself.」"
msgstr "Minori「Pero a veces me preocupa cuando＿se esfuerza demasiado.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「There's no shortage of reasons to be＿worried about her......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No faltan motivos para preocuparse＿por ella......」"

msgid "Minori「I'm sure Taiga's happy that you＿recognize that.」"
msgstr "Minori「Seguro que a Taiga le alegra＿que te des cuenta de eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You think so?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Tú crees?」"

msgid "Minori「That's one of her good points.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ese es uno de sus puntos buenos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You... think so?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Tú... crees?」"

msgid "Minori「You don't get how truly kind Taiga is.」"
msgstr "Minori「No sabes lo amable que es Taiga.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Minori「There are times when Taiga's too＿nice......」"
msgstr "Minori「Hay veces en que Taiga es＿demasiado amable......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Too nice......? What do you mean \"too\"＿nice?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Demasiado amable......? ¿A qué te＿refieres con \"demasiado\" amable?」"

msgid "Minori「Oh...... Well, if you spend enough time＿with Taiga, you'll see what I mean.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ah...... Bueno, si pasas bastante tiempo＿con Taiga, verás a qué me refiero.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............I see.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............Ya veo.」"

msgid "Minori「I think it's a sign that she's healthy.」"
msgstr "Minori「Creo que es señal de que está sana.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Fair enough......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tiene sentido......」"

msgid "Minori「Oh no, is she overeating from stress?」"
msgstr "Minori「Ay no, ¿come de más por estrés?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Stress? From what?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Estrés? ¿Por qué?」"

msgid "Minori「......From being forgotten, maybe......?」"
msgstr "Minori「......¿Será porque la olvidaste......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm? Did you say something?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mm? ¿Dijiste algo?」"

msgid "Minori「No, it's nothing.」"
msgstr "Minori「No, no es nada.」"

msgid "Minori「It's invigorating to watch!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Es vigorizante verla!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Invigorating is one way to put it, yeah,＿but I'm usually more concerned that＿she'll spill food on her clothes.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Vigorizante es una forma de decirlo,＿sí, pero a mí me suele preocupar más＿que se manche la ropa de comida.」"

msgid "Minori「Hahaha! I bet!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Jajaja! ¡Me lo imagino!」"

msgid "Minori「Hm? Are you concerned about how＿you'll be able to continue feeding her＿in the future?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Mm? ¿Te preocupa cómo podrás seguir＿alimentándola en el futuro?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The future has nothing to do with it!＿Where'd that come from?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡El futuro no tiene nada que＿ver! ¿De dónde sacaste eso?」"

msgid "Minori「Fufu! Sure, let's go with that.」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Juju! Claro, digamos que sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's that supposed to mean......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué se supone que significa eso......?」"

msgid "Minori「Whether we do, whether we don't,＿woo-haaah! As long as it's SCARY!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Lo veamos o no, uuu-jaaa!＿¡Con tal de que dé MIEDO!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I see. That's good......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y-Ya veo. Qué bien......」"

msgid "Minori「Eee hee hee hee hee hee!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Iii ji ji ji ji ji!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kushieda!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Kushieda?!」"

msgid "Minori「Who knows if we'll be able to see it......＿Ehehehehe!」"
msgstr "Minori「Quién sabe si podremos verlo......＿¡Ejejejeje!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Calm down. Your giggles are starting＿to sound like Haruta.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cálmate. Tu risita ya está empezando＿a sonar como la de Haruta.」"

msgid "Minori「I think the mystery is part of the fun.」"
msgstr "Minori「El misterio es parte de la diversión.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, I guess. You might be right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, supongo. Puede que tengas razón.」"

msgid "Minori「...That question...」"
msgstr "Minori「...Esa pregunta...」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Was I rude......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿Fui grosero......?」"

msgid "Minori「Not really.」"
msgstr "Minori「En realidad no.」"

msgid "Minori「A mood-killer statement like that? No＿thank you!」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Una frase aguafiestas como＿esa? ¡No, gracias!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, oops.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ups.」"

msgid "Minori「I see, so you don't know right now......」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya veo, así que ahora no lo sabes......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「Nothing.」"
msgstr "Minori「Nada.」"

msgid "Minori「Really? So ghosts have to be pretty to＿be acknowledged? That's sad.」"
msgstr "Minori「¿En serio? ¿Los fantasmas tienen＿que ser lindos para ser reconocidos?＿Qué triste.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The ugly ones are monsters,＿apparently.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Los feos son monstruos, al parecer.」"

msgid "Minori「That classification...... makes me sad.」"
msgstr "Minori「Esa clasificación...... me entristece.」"

msgid "Minori「I see...... But if it's a soldier ghost or＿something, we won't know whether＿he'll be handsome......」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya veo...... Pero si es el fantasma＿de un soldado o algo así, no sabremos＿si será apuesto......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「As far as I know, the ugly ones are＿monsters, so wouldn't that apply to＿soldier ghosts as well?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Que yo sepa, los feos son monstruos,＿¿así que eso no se aplicaría también＿a los fantasmas de soldados?」"

msgid "Minori「So that's how they're classified......」"
msgstr "Minori「Así que así es como los clasifican......」"

msgid "Minori「Now I want to see it even more!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ahora quiero verlo aún más!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「By the way, the ugly ones are＿monsters, apparently.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Por cierto, los feos son＿monstruos, al parecer.」"

msgid "Minori「I don't mind if it's a monster either.」"
msgstr "Minori「Tampoco me importa si es un monstruo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So you'd be up for anything......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así que te da igual lo que sea......」"

msgid "Minori「Prettier than Amin, I wonder?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Más hermoso que Amin, me pregunto?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「We probably shouldn't compare a dead＿person with the living......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Probablemente no deberíamos comparar＿a un muerto con los vivos......」"

msgid "Minori「Oh man～ I wanted to give Haruta-kun＿1000 points for his sweet moves! He＿nailed it!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Vaya～, quería darle 1000 puntos＿a Haruta-kun por sus geniales pasos!＿¡Le salió perfecto!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, he was unbelievably good at＿aerobics.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, era increíblemente＿bueno en aeróbicos.」"

msgid "Minori「That was fun! Whoops, just thinking＿back on it is making me drool. Avert＿thy eyes!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Fue divertido! Ups, solo recordarlo＿me hace babear. ¡Aparta la mirada!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What the hell are you thinking back＿on......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué diablos estás recordando......?」"

msgid "Minori「Aww, I wanna hang out there again, but＿it's so expensive...... It's a hard knock＿life!」"
msgstr "Minori「Aaah, quiero ir de nuevo ahí, pero es＿tan caro...... ¡Qué dura es la vida!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「For us......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Para nosotros......」"

msgid "Minori「I'm grateful that Noto-kun invited me.」"
msgstr "Minori「Le agradezco a Noto-kun que me invitara.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Me too.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo también.」"

msgid "Minori「Well, not everyone is a fan of＿something like this.」"
msgstr "Minori「Bueno, no todo el mundo es＿fan de algo como esto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, that's true. You're right. It would＿be bad if this traumatized them.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, es verdad. Tienes razón. Sería＿malo que esto las traumatizara.」"

msgid "Minori「It'd be near-impossible for all of us to＿stay together forever......」"
msgstr "Minori「Sería casi imposible que todos＿siguiéramos juntos para siempre......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Minori「......」"
msgstr "Minori「......」"

msgid "Minori「Still, for a midwinter's test of courage,＿we got plenty of people.」"
msgstr "Minori「Aun así, para una prueba de valor en＿pleno invierno, somos bastante gente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「True. 6 is plenty.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cierto. Con 6 basta.」"

msgid "Minori「Yep yep!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Sí, sí!」"

msgid "Minori「Ohhh～? But not Noto, is that it～?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Ohhh～? Pero Noto no, ¿verdad～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「When I said Kihara, I meant both her＿and Noto.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cuando dije Kihara, me refería＿a ella y a Noto.」"

msgid "Minori「Ooooh?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Ooooh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's true!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Es verdad!」"

msgid "Minori「No shortage of worries, huh?」"
msgstr "Minori「No faltan preocupaciones, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「For me, at least......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Para mí, al menos......」"

msgid "Minori「Do you hope to remember everything?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Esperas recordarlo todo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, yeah...... Kushieda, is something＿wrong?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, sí...... Kushieda, ¿pasa algo?」"

msgid "Minori「No, nothing's wrong.」"
msgstr "Minori「No, no pasa nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Really......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿De verdad......?」"

msgid "Minori「It's okay. If you're ever in trouble, we'll＿help you out.」"
msgstr "Minori「Está bien. Si alguna vez tienes＿problemas, te ayudaremos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Right. Thanks.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro. Gracias.」"

msgid "Minori「Why not rebrand yourself as \"Neo＿Takasu-kun\" this time around?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Por qué no te reinventas como＿\"Neo Takasu-kun\" esta vez?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's \"Neo\"......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué es \"Neo\"......?」"

msgid "Minori「That's RIIIGHT! The diet warriors are＿preparing for it at present! 'Tis a daily＿battle!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡ASÍ EEES! ¡Las guerreras de la dieta＿se están preparando ahora mismo!＿¡Es una batalla diaria!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh. Don't overdo it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah. No te excedas.」"

msgid "Minori「Whoa there, don't say another word! I'll＿smile until my face melts!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ey, no digas más! ¡Voy a sonreír＿hasta que se me derrita la cara!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are you that excited about it!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Tanto te emociona?!」"

msgid "Minori「Ehehehehehe!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ejejejejeje!」"

msgid "Minori「Since we're going to Okinawa and all,＿I'm glad I got some swimming practice＿in.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya que vamos a Okinawa y todo,＿me alegra haber practicado＿un poco de natación.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. Shame it was only a little.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. Lástima que fuera solo un poco.」"

msgid "Minori「I'm SO looking forward to Okinawa～!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Tengo TANTAS ganas de ir a Okinawa～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Me too. I hope it'll be sunny.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo también. Ojalá esté soleado.」"

msgid "Minori「Why? We'll get to see our classmates＿again. It'll be fun.」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Por qué? Volveremos a ver a nuestros＿compañeros. Será divertido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm...... still a little bummed about my＿amnesia.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Todavía...... me desanima un＿poco lo de mi amnesia.」"

msgid "Minori「Hmm......」"
msgstr "Minori「Mmm......」"

msgid "Minori「Hey, Takasu-kun! The duty of all＿students is to go to school! It's what＿being young is all about!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Oye, Takasu-kun! ¡El deber de todo＿estudiante es ir a la escuela! ¡De＿eso se trata ser joven!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's true, but...... I'm still a little＿bummed about my amnesia.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es verdad, pero...... todavía me＿desanima un poco lo de mi amnesia.」"

msgid "Minori「No running away! No running away! No＿running away! SAY IT!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡No debo huir! ¡No debo huir!＿¡No debo huir! ¡DILO!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Uh...... No running away, no＿running away, no running away......? Is＿it some kind of good-luck charm......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? Eh...... ¿No debo huir, no debo＿huir, no debo huir......? ¿Es algún＿tipo de amuleto......?」"

msgid "Minori「What～? Don't say that when we'll get＿to reunite with our classmates......」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Cómo～? No digas eso: vamos a reunirnos＿con nuestros compañeros......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, I'm a little concerned about my＿amnesia. I wish I could remember a＿little more, if only random stuff.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, me preocupa un poco mi amnesia.＿Ojalá pudiera recordar un poco más,＿aunque fueran cosas al azar.」"

msgid "Minori「I see......」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya veo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, it is......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, lo es......」"

msgid "Minori「Don't be such a downer......」"
msgstr "Minori「No te deprimas así......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh...... sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah...... perdón.」"

msgid "Minori「We still have three more months. We＿gotta enjoy them to the fullest.」"
msgstr "Minori「Todavía nos quedan tres meses más.＿Tenemos que disfrutarlos al máximo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah...... You're right. We still have＿the school field trip.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí...... Tienes razón. Todavía＿nos queda el viaje escolar.」"

msgid "Minori「Yep yep! There's still more fun to be＿had!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Sí, sí! ¡Todavía queda mucha＿diversión por delante!」"

msgid "Minori「What's this? Getting sentimental on＿me?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Y esto? ¿Te estás poniendo＿sentimental conmigo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, that's not it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no es eso.」"

